WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:04,970
The system also wants us to try something new, but you’re right

2
00:00:05,290 --> 00:00:06,330
Can't risk myself

3
00:00:06,890 --> 00:00:08,130
I need to find some guinea pigs to try.

4
00:00:08,610 --> 00:00:10,280
white mouse

5
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,790
Small animals are more sensitive to toxins, rats are best

6
00:00:14,310 --> 00:00:15,540
Their resistance to poison is weaker than humans

7
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:16,820
It'll be fine if you eat it

8
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:34,540
It basically proves that we can eat it too, so be careful. He is not a lost cow, but he has mutated and is very strong. Don’t mess with him.

9
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:39,540
He seems to still have it

10
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:40,580
mutated latent instinct

11
00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:42,970
I didn't know I had become so strong

12
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:44,890
So I stayed in the fence obediently

13
00:00:45,810 --> 00:00:46,970
Then let's not disturb him

14
00:00:47,810 --> 00:00:49,810
I'll send you some mutated vegetables later.

15
00:00:50,290 --> 00:00:51,250
See if he eats

16
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:52,370
Have you adapted to the situation?

17
00:00:52,770 --> 00:00:56,960
It's just a good idea to help us observe. Let's go to Zhangqian first.
